[EOG]

[{TEXT_GROUP_MULTILINE}]
# Markdown Example

This text group contains markdown content.

## Features
- Bullet points
- **Bold text**
- *Italic text*

Code block:
```
if (x > 5) {
    return true;
}
```

[GROUP] markers mid-line are literal text.
[EOG]

[{TEXT_GROUP_CODE}]
function parseQSet(content) {
    const lines = content.split('\n');
    const groups = {};

    for (let line of lines) {
        // Process line with | delimiters
        if (line.includes('|')) {
            const fields = line.split('|');
        }
    }

    return groups;
}
[EOG]

